    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7cb99d23-50d2-54da-9695-b1dbc10c7d4b" activityNameId="7cd09d04-7d29-5bb4-a385-1e3f14097269" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Vinasse, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Vinasse, at regional storehouse
The multioutput-process "sugar beets, to fermentation" delivers the co-products Ethanol, 95% in H20, from sugar beets",  "beets chips", and vinasse. The allocation is based on mass balance and economic criteria. World production of ethanol from sugar beets is around 10 Mio hl per year.;
UUID: ef482d77-eeb2-345a-89f4-1067a43581f9
Fermentation of sugar beets including materials, energy uses, infrastructure, and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production of ethanol from sugar beets with extraction, fermentation, and distillation of ethanol.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: The world production of ethanol from sugar beets is around 10 Mio hl per year.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Some data are derived from other or unknown plants or have been estimated.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ef482d77-eeb2-345a-89f4-1067a43581f9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
